MODULE json_strict

FUNCTION create strict JSON decoder from bytes and source name
    reject metadata over 4 MiB and JSON nested beyond 256 levels
    parse the complete JSON grammar while tracking keys in every object
    reject duplicate keys in any object
    configure the typed decoder to reject unknown fields
    return the decoder

FUNCTION require JSON end
    after decoding one typed value, require end-of-input
    reject a second value or malformed trailing content

The duplicate-key parser handles objects, arrays, strings, literals, and
numbers, reports byte positions, validates string escapes and number syntax,
and requires the complete input to be consumed.
